      "translation": {
        "english_text": "(Having learned from his daughter Muthammal that Durjayan was the one who had been the death of his daughter's honour and his son's life, Kalingan goes to the palace to expose his plots. Gopativarman, after pronouncing judgment on Kandiban, is in the inner palace.)",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
