      "translation": {
        "english_text": "(Having learned the truth, the king comes toward the sacrificial altar to save Kandiban. Muthammal comes toward the altar to avenge herself on Durjayan for violating her honour; Kalingan too comes, enraged that Durjayan deceived him, made his son prince, and killed him.)",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source closes this final unlabelled direction with an extra right parenthesis; the canonical Tamil remains unchanged."
